"Your English is good"

506
00:47:27,593 --> 00:47:29,293
ってコメントが来てると思う！
I'm sure comments like that are coming in!

507
00:47:29,493 --> 00:47:30,693
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

508
00:47:31,093 --> 00:47:31,893
でも！
But!

509
00:47:31,993 --> 00:47:35,693
みんなもっと気になるところがあったかなと思うんですが
I think there were some things you were even more curious about...

510
00:47:36,393 --> 00:47:37,593
あ、車ね？
Ah, the car, right?

511
00:47:37,693 --> 00:47:39,293
攻めてたね！
That was bold!

512
00:47:39,493 --> 00:47:41,893
あとはパラパラ踊るギリ割るロボね
And the Giriwaru robot dancing Para Para!

513
00:47:41,993 --> 00:47:45,993
やりたい放題させていただいて、とっても楽しかったです！
We got to do whatever we wanted, and it was so much fun!

514
00:47:46,293 --> 00:47:48,993
でも！まだ終わりじゃない！
But! We're not done yet!

515
00:47:49,193 --> 00:47:52,593
ちょっと着替えてくるので、待っててくださーい！
I'm going to go change, so please wait for me!

516
00:47:52,693 --> 00:47:53,693
はーい！
Okay~!

517
00:47:53,793 --> 00:47:58,693
よいしょ、よいしょ... 着替えて、着替えて... ふぅ...
Heave-ho, heave-ho... changing, changing... whew...

518
00:48:00,493 --> 00:48:01,693
はーい！
Alright!

519
00:48:03,193 --> 00:48:04,893
あ、もう着替え終わった！
Ah, I'm already done changing!

520
00:48:05,293 --> 00:48:06,393
さて！
Now then!

521
00:48:06,493 --> 00:48:08,093
次の曲なんですが...
As for the next song...

522
00:48:08,193 --> 00:48:09,393
なんと！
Believe it or not...

523
00:48:09,493 --> 00:48:11,693
なんかみんなもう知ってそうだけど
Although I feel like you all know already...

524
00:48:11,793 --> 00:48:13,893
次の曲は新曲！
The next song is a brand-new song!

525
00:48:13,993 --> 00:48:16,893
『灰色の証明』をやります！
I'll be performing "Haiiro no Shoumei"!

526
00:48:17,493 --> 00:48:20,793
わためチャンネルにてMV公開中なので
The MV is out right now on the Watame Channel,

527
00:48:20,893 --> 00:48:23,093
MVもぜひ見てくださーい！
so please go check out the MV as well!

528
00:48:23,593 --> 00:48:26,193
そして楽曲リリースもしているので
And the song is also officially released,

529
00:48:26,293 --> 00:48:29,093
「いいな」と思ったらぜひ買ってください！
so if you like it, please be sure to buy it!

530
00:48:29,493 --> 00:48:30,893
よろしくお願いします！
Thank you so much!

531
00:48:31,393 --> 00:48:32,593
では！
Now then!

532
00:48:32,693 --> 00:48:34,693
新曲『灰色の証明』
The new song, "Haiiro no Shoumei",

533
00:48:34,793 --> 00:48:37,693
魂込めて歌います！
I'll sing it with all my soul!

534
00:48:37,793 --> 00:48:39,593
聴いてください
Please listen.

535
00:48:45,693 --> 00:48:50,693
灰色の証明
[Proof of Gray]

536
00:49:03,193 --> 00:49:07,493
静寂に包まれた ゼロ地点の感情
Sentiments at ground zero, wrapped in silence.

537
00:49:07,693 --> 00:49:12,693
期待を背負っているのは 私ではないから
Since I'm not the one carrying expectations,

538
00:49:12,793 --> 00:49:17,493
主人公はいつだって 輝いている誰かで
the protagonist is always someone who shines bright,

539
00:49:17,593 --> 00:49:20,893
見上げるだけじゃ 何も変わらない
and just looking up changes nothing.

540
00:49:20,993 --> 00:49:25,093
今この時だけの
Exclusive to this exact moment,

541
00:49:25,093 --> 00:49:29,393
瞬間的な優位性で 駆け抜けて
I sprint through with momentary superiority!

542
00:49:29,493 --> 00:49:34,393
灰色の空 裂いて "私"の全てを
Tearing through the gray sky with all that I am,

543
00:49:34,493 --> 00:49:39,493
"運命の物語"に 叩きつけて 打ち砕け
I slam against the scenario of fate and smash it to pieces!

544
00:49:39,593 --> 00:49:43,193
自信は微塵もない あるのは渇望だけ
Without a shred of confidence, driven solely by desire,

545
00:49:43,293 --> 00:49:48,493
ただ自分の生命を 証明しよう
I will simply prove my own existence,

546
00:49:48,593 --> 00:49:52,693
"此処"にいた事を 刻むように
as if to engrave the fact that I was right here!

547
00:50:02,074 --> 00:50:05,374
綺麗な勝ち方は望むべくもない
I can't even dream of a clean win,

548
00:50:05,674 --> 00:50:08,374
華やかさも必要ない
nor do I need any glamour.

549
00:50:08,574 --> 00:50:11,074
それが私だから
Because that's who I am.

550
00:50:11,374 --> 00:50:15,074
歴史はいつだって勝者が作るモノ
History is always made by the victors,

551
00:50:15,274 --> 00:50:18,774
だけど記憶はその限りじゃない
but memories aren't bound by that.

552
00:50:19,274 --> 00:50:23,174
今この時だけは
Only for this moment,

553
00:50:23,374 --> 00:50:27,974
決断的な刹那性に飛び込んでいけ
plunge right into this decisive, fleeting second.

554
00:50:28,574 --> 00:50:33,174
灰色で描く“私”の思いが
My feelings, painted in shades of gray,

555
00:50:33,574 --> 00:50:37,574
美しき痛みをも乗り越えて書き換えてく
overcome even beautiful pain, rewriting everything.

556
00:50:37,574 --> 00:50:39,674
後悔は1ミリもない
I don't have a single regret.

557
00:50:39,674 --> 00:50:42,374
あるのは灼熱だけ
There is only scorching heat,

558
00:50:42,374 --> 00:50:46,774
ただ自分の生命を蹴り上げるように
as if kicking my very life into high gear.

559
00:50:47,774 --> 00:50:51,774
始まりは些細 最早どうだっていい
The beginning was trivial, and it doesn't matter anymore.

560
00:50:52,074 --> 00:50:56,774
突き動かされ指先を伸ばす
Driven forward, I reach out with my fingertips.

561
00:51:05,274 --> 00:51:10,274
現実は残酷だと気付いていないわけじゃない
It's not that I don't realize reality is cruel.

562
00:51:10,474 --> 00:51:14,974
諦めるその時は“今”ではなかったらしい
It seems the time to give up was not "now."

563
00:51:15,274 --> 00:51:19,674
灰色の空高くもう一度点火して
Igniting once more high into the gray sky,

564
00:51:19,674 --> 00:51:24,174
ただ自分の生命を証明しよう
I will simply prove my existence,

565
00:51:24,174 --> 00:51:31,274
そこにいた事を刻むように
as if engraving the fact that I was here.

566
00:51:36,974 --> 00:51:39,174
It's a second chance, new answer

567
00:51:39,174 --> 00:51:41,674
声を張れ Realize
raise your voice and realize.

568
00:51:41,674 --> 00:51:44,274
I can't change the past forever

569
00:51:44,274 --> 00:51:46,974
私の Future is one way slide
my future is a one-way slide.

570
00:51:57,274 --> 00:51:58,674
はい！
All right!

571
00:51:58,674 --> 00:52:02,274
ということで新曲「灰色の証明」！
So that was my new song, "Proof of Gray"!

572
00:52:02,474 --> 00:52:05,674
やったー！披露できたー！
Yay! I finally performed it!

573
00:52:05,674 --> 00:52:07,574
やっと証明できたー！
I finally proved it!

574
00:52:07,774 --> 00:52:11,074
聴いてくれてありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for listening!

575
00:52:11,474 --> 00:52:18,274
この楽曲は岸田教団&THE明星ロケッツの皆さんに制作していただきまして
This song was created for me by Kishida Kyoudan & THE Akeboshi Rockets,

576
00:52:18,474 --> 00:52:23,674
スポーツだったり みんなが頑張りたい時に
and I wanted to create a cheer song that could give people strength in sports,

577
00:52:23,674 --> 00:52:26,474
力になれるような応援ソングを作りたいと思い
or whenever they want to give it their all,

578
00:52:26,474 --> 00:52:31,374
色々語ったらかなり熱くてカッコいい楽曲に仕上がりました！
and after talking it through, it turned into a super passionate and cool song!

579
00:52:31,574 --> 00:52:36,274
上手くいかないことがあっても また立ち上がって前に進む
Even when things don't go well, you get back up and move forward.

580
00:52:36,474 --> 00:52:43,774
わためにとっても背中を押してくれる そんな特別な楽曲に今回のライブになりました！
Through this live show, it became a really special song that pushes Watame forward too!

581
00:52:43,974 --> 00:52:46,774
みんなにとってもそうだったら嬉しいです！
I'd be so happy if it does the same for all of you!

582
00:52:47,274 --> 00:52:51,974
こちらの新曲MVいっぱい見て 楽曲もぜひ購入して
I'd be super happy if you watch the new MV a lot, buy the song,

583
00:52:51,974 --> 00:52:56,974
わための音楽を応援していただけたらとっても嬉しいです！
and support Watame's music!

584
00:52:57,274 --> 00:53:00,474
目指せ！武道館ライブ！
Aiming for a Budokan live concert!

585
00:53:00,974 --> 00:53:05,774
と、あ、ここでまだ告知していないものが一つありまして
And, ah, there's one more announcement I haven't made yet...

586
00:53:05,774 --> 00:53:07,474
ライブじゃないんですけど…
It's not a live show, but...

587
00:53:07,574 --> 00:53:08,874
なんと！
Believe it or not!

588
00:53:09,174 --> 00:53:10,974
ドドーン！
Ta-da!

