描いていこう（yeah!） 花びらいっぱいのステージを
Let's paint (yeah!) a stage filled with flower petals!

644
00:57:12,529 --> 00:57:16,329
fever fever 叶えていこう（fever!）
Fever fever, let's make it come true (fever!)

645
00:57:16,329 --> 00:57:20,229
ほらまた目覚める bloomy cue!
Look, awakening once again, bloomy cue!

646
