並行世界をぎゅっとねじ曲げ（hey! 行こう!）
Twisting parallel worlds tightly (hey! Let's go!)

647
00:57:24,229 --> 00:57:28,229
きっと出会えた今なんだ ベストな世界線に（hey!） いるんだよ？ ciao!
Surely we met now, on the best world line (hey!), right? Ciao!

648
00:57:28,229 --> 00:57:32,229
“夢”と“あいまいな目標”ってどう違う？
How are "dreams" and "vague goals" different?

649
00:57:32,229 --> 00:57:36,229
（you got this, ねぇ goddess） 掘ろっか答え探し
(You got this, hey goddess) Shall we dig to find the answer?

650
