わくわくしたら夢なんだ 大丈夫信じて
If it gets you excited, it's a dream! Don't worry, believe in it!

651
00:57:40,229 --> 00:57:44,229
贈り合いましょう（yeah!） 吼えるようなエールを（yeah!）
Let's send each other (yeah!) roaring cheers! (yeah!)

652
00:57:44,229 --> 00:57:48,229
響かせよう 君の中疼いてる
Let's make it echo! The aching inside you,

653
00:57:48,229 --> 00:57:52,229
咲きたい蕾たちへ合図を（yeah!）
give the signal to the buds waiting to bloom (yeah!)

654
00:57:52,229 --> 00:57:56,229
いっせいに送るよ（yeah!） ひらけ！と
sending it all at once (yeah!), saying "Open up!"

655
00:57:56,229 --> 00:58:00,229
また一つみつけた 君と出会えたことの意味を
Found another one: the meaning of meeting you!

656
00:58:00,229 --> 00:58:04,229
フレー フレー フレー fever fever
Hurrah, hurrah, hurrah, fever fever!

657
00:58:04,229 --> 00:58:08,229
描いていこう（yeah!） 花びらいっぱいのステージを
Let's paint (yeah!) a stage filled with flower petals!

658
00:58:08,229 --> 00:58:12,229
fever fever 叶えていこう（fever!）
Fever fever, let's make it come true (fever!)

659
00:58:12,229 --> 00:58:16,229
ほらまた目覚める bloomy cue!
Look, awakening once again, bloomy cue!

660
00:58:16,229 --> 00:58:20,229
everybody, go for it! 内なるモンスター
Everybody, go for it! The monster within,

661
00:58:20,229 --> 00:58:24,229
閉じ込めた背中のファスナー ちゃんと堪えた
zipped up on your back—you endured it well!

662
00:58:24,229 --> 00:58:28,229
ガマン強い君が master 内なる diva を信じてね forever
Patient as you are, you're the master! Believe in your inner diva forever!

663
00:58:28,229 --> 00:58:32,229
踊ろうよ dreamer 時の神のご自慢の（hey!）
Let's dance, dreamer! The God of Time's proud (hey!)

